<title>SWEDEN: S-E-Banken says to become EBS partner.</title>
<headline>S-E-Banken says to become EBS partner.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank S-E-Banken said on Wednesday it had become a partner of currency trading system EBS (Electronic Broking Services).</p>
<p>&quot;Becoming a partner in EBS gives S-E-Banken the opportunity to influence the development and to increase liquidity in Scandinavian currencies,&quot; S-E-Banken said.</p>
</text>
